#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0002 expect=noViolation domain=ADAE
#note "The domain=\"*\" scan never compares a variable against its OWN dataset: AEXFL lives only in the primary ADAE, so no other dataset supplies a label and the rule cannot fire (the primary is excluded, not matched against itself). W4b (PLAN-scalar-metadata-functions phase 0, scenarios-first on the pre-port engine)."
dataset ADAE
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col AEXFL type=Char label="Only Here Flag"
